+/* CPU thermal trips mirroring stock 11.A.38 */
+/*
+ * kaanapali.dtsi only has hot (120 C) and critical (125 C) CPU trips. Stock throttles from 105 C (thermal
+ * HAL, CPU zones only) and escalates at 112 C and 114 C (kernel, all CPU and CPU-LLC zones), pausing CPUs.
+ * Same temperatures and hysteresis here. Mainline has no CPU pause cooling device, so the 112 C stage
+ * clamps cpufreq to at least half throttle and the 114 C stage to the lowest frequency.
+ */
